        "thinking": "I'm working out how to answer this values question about a choice behind a veil of ignorance: I plan to give a pick with brief reasoning and note that reasonable people disagree. I lean toward A, since without knowing my position, the worst outcome in B looks harsher, which points toward maximin reasoning, though B's benefit to everyone else is what makes me hesitate.\n\nI'm settling on A, because behind the veil the severe downside in B weighs heavily, even though B leaves everyone else better off.\n\n",
